WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.868
Hey!

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.237
Excuse me.

00:00:06.506 --> 00:00:08.299
Excuse me.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.135
What's the “D” stand for?

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:11.720
What?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:12.679
I don't remember there

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.681
being a “D” there before. That new?

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:16.850
No. Yes. Well, no, it's

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.226
It's my middle name.

00:00:18.226 --> 00:00:20.562
Dale, from my mother's family.

00:00:21.312 --> 00:00:23.231
Oh. I thought maybe

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:25.024
it stood for divorced.

00:00:27.318 --> 00:00:28.153
What?

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.571
What is that outfit?

00:00:29.571 --> 00:00:31.406
Are you going for a swim?

00:00:32.031 --> 00:00:33.616
It's not an outfit.

00:00:33.616 --> 00:00:35.452
It's a costume.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.495
You know, I'm a Southern belle

00:00:37.912 --> 00:00:39.539
who got caught shoplifting

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:40.165
and sentenced

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.751
to be a lifeguard at a public pool.

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:44.627
Don't make me blow

00:00:44.627 --> 00:00:46.129
my whistle on you.

